1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,804
Who is on duty?

2
00:00:02,818 --> 00:00:04,280
He might have leaped back.

3
00:00:04,749 --> 00:00:07,678
Then there is no more to
be done in the matter.

4
00:00:08,521 --> 00:00:11,518
The place we want must be
somewhere near that line.

5
00:00:12,329 --> 00:00:14,123
said my wife, pulling up her veil

6
00:00:15,048 --> 00:00:16,276
Will you come with me?

7
00:00:16,721 --> 00:00:18,178
Why, it is after nine now

8
00:00:18,703 --> 00:00:20,884
Walk past me, and
then look back at me.

9
00:00:21,164 --> 00:00:23,203
There is some building going on there
